    {
      "id": "en.n8.class-42.t01",
      "en": "Please don't spill the beans about the party; it is a secret.",
      "es": "Por favor, no reveles lo de la fiesta; es un secreto.",
      "explanationEs": "Spill the beans es un modismo flexible: el verbo cambia de forma, el resto (the beans) no.",
